### ==========================================================================
### SecureBank Connect - VS Code REST Client Test Scenarios
### (Use with VS Code REST Client extension)
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@appId = app_finpulse_9281
@apiKey = sb_live_finpulse_k9281a

### 1. Gateway Health & Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitoring/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 2. Request OAuth2 Scoped Bearer Token
# @name oauthToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "app_finpulse_9281",
  "client_secret": "sec_live_9a8f7c6e5d4b",
  "customer_id": "CUST-1001",
  "scopes": ["accounts:read", "balances:read", "transactions:read"]
}

### 3. List Customer Accounts (Using Bearer Token)
@authToken = {{oauthToken.response.body.access_token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Account Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-US-8901/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Account Transactions (Filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/ACC-US-8901/transactions?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Initiate Payment (Simulated Transfer)
# Note: FinPulse app does not have payments:create scope -> Expect 403 Forbidden!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_account_id": "ACC-US-8901",
  "to_account_id": "ACC-US-8903",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "reference": "Monthly SaaS subscription"
}

### 7. Trigger Live Attack / Traffic Simulation (Normal Traffic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/simulate/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": "normal"
}

### 8. Trigger Live Traffic Burst / DDoS Attack (Triggers AI Anomaly Flag)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/simulate/traffic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": "burst"
}

### 9. View AI Security Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/monitoring/alerts
Accept: application/json
